 Metal 3.1 like airconv

Without a target the SDK's newest is used (air64_v29-apple-macosx27.2.0 with the
Xcode 27 toolchain), which Metal on macOS 26 and older cannot load.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
